<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong SFC names Dickens head of enforcement.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong SFC names Dickens head of enforcement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) said on Monday it had appointed Mark Dickens as a member of the commission and executive director as from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Dickens, 44, will be head of the securities watchdog's Enforcement Division, succeeding Gerard McMahon whose contract expires on December 31.</p>
<p>He is currently the SFC's Senior Director, Corporate Finance, overseeing areas such as takeover regulation, listing policy and corporate governance.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
